pmc:AshtarTransmissionOblowReceiving a pm:Receiving ;
    rdfs:label "The work's claim that the message of 12 April 1952 is from Oblow"@en, "Die Behauptung des Werkes, die Botschaft vom 12 April 1952 stamme von Oblow"@de ;
    skos:definition "The work prints under the date 12 April 1952 a message signed by Oblow, who says mortals have nothing to fear from Schare, that they will come in peace, that interference will be wiped out, and that they forgot ages ago that destruction served any purpose."@en ;
    skos:note "This node records the claim, not its truth. The citation names Van Tassel as author because that is what a reader can obtain; the title page itself says the book was radioed by other-world intelligences through him."@en ;
