pmc:AshtarTransmissionKletarcReceiving a pm:Receiving ;
    rdfs:label "The work's claim that the message of 23 May 1952 is from Kletarc"@en, "Die Behauptung des Werkes, die Botschaft vom 23 May 1952 stamme von Kletarc"@de ;
    skos:definition "The work prints under the date 23 May 1952 a message signed by Kletarc, who answers a request for the next day's news: a famous woman in a controversy leading to international conflict, a crisis for the nation in September, fresh aggression in the Far East in July."@en ;
    skos:note "This node records the claim, not its truth. The citation names Van Tassel as author because that is what a reader can obtain; the title page itself says the book was radioed by other-world intelligences through him."@en ;
