    rdfs:label "The work's claim that the message of 13 June 1952 is from Tonla"@en, "Die Behauptung des Werkes, die Botschaft vom 13 June 1952 stamme von Tonla"@de ;
    skos:definition "The work prints under the date 13 June 1952 a message signed by Tonla, who says they heard the group's earlier discussion and disregard it, that their purpose is told to nobody, and that his whole fleet has been tuned so that radion projections help the group receive from Uni."@en ;
    skos:note "This node records the claim, not its truth. The citation names Van Tassel as author because that is what a reader can obtain; the title page itself says the book was radioed by other-world intelligences through him."@en ;
