    rdfs:label "The work's claim that the message of 6 July 1952 is from Dulac"@en, "Die Behauptung des Werkes, die Botschaft vom 6 July 1952 stamme von Dulac"@de ;
    skos:definition "The work prints under the date 6 July 1952 a message signed by Dulac, who says he has been told to direct the combined power of his waves to ray the group a substance good for the physical body, from 4300 miles above, and that the ray is now on them."@en ;
    skos:note "This node records the claim, not its truth. The citation names Van Tassel as author because that is what a reader can obtain; the title page itself says the book was radioed by other-world intelligences through him."@en ;
