    rdfs:label "The work's claim that the message of 18 July 1952 is from Portla"@en, "Die Behauptung des Werkes, die Botschaft vom 18 July 1952 stamme von Portla"@de ;
    skos:definition "The work prints under the date 18 July 1952 a message signed by Portla, who announces a ventla bringing their chief, the commandant of station Schare over the first four sectors, on his first entry into this solar system, who will tell the group its purpose; says they have meanwhile rayed the substance for better reception."@en ;
    skos:note "This node records the claim, not its truth. The citation names Van Tassel as author because that is what a reader can obtain; the title page itself says the book was radioed by other-world intelligences through him."@en ;
