    skos:definition "The work prints under the dates 8 and 10 August 1952 a message signed by Blaroc, who says much is held back because a security law of the receiver's nation could expose him to a charge of treason; forecasts an earthquake in the southern hemisphere and sightings over the main cities of all countries; and says the governments will learn the other object of the visits once they give up developing hydrogen weapons."@en ;
