    rdfs:label "The work's claim that the message of 17 August 1952 is from Noot"@en, "Die Behauptung des Werkes, die Botschaft vom 17 August 1952 stamme von Noot"@de ;
    skos:definition "The work prints under the date 17 August 1952 a message signed by Noot, who says he is to send the group, without pause, a beam of substance on a vibration above the ultraviolet for better inner perception, which they can feel more whenever they gather by joining hands, except while projections from Lem and Cor are coming in."@en ;
    skos:note "This node records the claim, not its truth. The citation names Van Tassel as author because that is what a reader can obtain; the title page itself says the book was radioed by other-world intelligences through him."@en ;
