pmc:AshtarTransmissionEonsPastReceiving a pm:Receiving ;
    rdfs:label "The work's claim that a closing reception on time and thought comes from an unnamed speaker"@en, "Die Behauptung des Werkes, eine abschließende Empfangung über Zeit und Denken stamme von einem ungenannten Sprecher"@de ;
    skos:definition "Inside the conclusion the author prints one more reception from the group's meetings, undated and unsigned, on time as effaced by eternity and on thought as a narrow line of light joining receptivity to inner being."@en ;
    skos:note "This node records the claim, not its truth. The epigraph on the title verso, a first-person saying of a creator about man, is not presented as a reception and is not entered."@en ;
