pmc:AshtarTransmissionAttunementContactYielding a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "The group's attunement, helped by the fleets, is said to bring contact through the arc, the level to cross the border, and reception from Uni"@en, "Die Einstimmung der Gruppe soll, von den Flotten unterstützt, Verbindung durch den Bogen, die Ebene zum Überschreiten der Grenze und Empfang von Uni bringen"@de ;
    skos:note "Four messages between 16 May and 13 June 1952 say the fleets are tuning their power to help the group; the help is the speakers' and the practice is the group's."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AshtarTransmissionAttunement ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AshtarTransmissionContactThroughTheArc, pmc:AshtarTransmissionCrossingTheBorder, pmc:AshtarTransmissionReceptionFromUni ;
