pmc:AshtarTransmissionPeaceThoughtYielding a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "A thought of peace is said to let one approach the light beings safely"@en, "Ein Gedanke des Friedens soll eine sichere Annäherung an die Lichtwesen erlauben"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AshtarTransmissionPeaceThought ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AshtarTransmissionSafeApproach ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:AshtarTransmission ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AshtarTransmissionIRodeAFlyingSaucer ;
