pmc:AshtarTransmissionLaxPrediction a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Forecast: the material-minded will be convinced"@en, "Vorhersage: die materiell Gesinnten werden überzeugt"@de ;
    skos:definition "Lax says the material-minded mortals will be convinced."@en ;
    skos:note "Undated and without a measure; Ashtar on 21 September says future demonstrations will establish the beings in the minds of most doubters."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a condition of failure: a forecast with an outcome in the public world, so that its not coming to pass would fall on the reception."@en ;
