pmc:AshtarTransmissionBlarocCitiesPrediction a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Forecast: projections seen over the main cities of all countries"@en, "Vorhersage: Projektionen über den wichtigsten Städten aller Länder"@de ;
    skos:definition "Blaroc says the projections are about to be seen by people in all countries over several of their most important cities, and that the beings foresee the failure of hidden control."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a condition of failure: a forecast with an outcome in the public world, so that its not coming to pass would fall on the reception."@en ;
