pmc:AshtarTransmissionUnderwaterPrediction a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Forecast: sightings under the surface of the oceans"@en, "Vorhersage: Sichtungen unter der Meeresoberfläche"@de ;
    skos:definition "Ashtar says the beings will shortly be seen beneath the water at many points of the oceans."@en ;
