pmc:AshtarTransmissionElectronicsPrediction a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Forecast: appearances in many forms and effects in electronic receivers"@en, "Vorhersage: Erscheinungen in vielen Formen und Wirkungen in elektronischen Empfängern"@de ;
    skos:definition "Ashtar says the beings will appear at various heights, forms, colours and speeds, some detectable by electronics and some not, and that beings now on earth will send carrier frequencies producing a variety of effects in electronic receivers."@en ;
    skos:note "The author later reads an arrow over Dallas as verification of this message; see pmc:AshtarTransmissionDallasSign."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a condition of failure: a forecast with an outcome in the public world, so that its not coming to pass would fall on the reception."@en ;
