pmc:AshtarTransmissionVortexDamagePrediction a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Forecast: extensive damage from a stabilizing vortex and violent disturbances"@en, "Vorhersage: großer Schaden durch einen stabilisierenden Wirbel und gewaltsame Erschütterungen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Ashtar says a light-energy vortex is being made near the earth to stabilize it and will do extensive damage, and two weeks later tells the group to prepare for violent disturbances, with first signs of success in arresting the earth's attitude."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a condition of failure: a forecast with an outcome in the public world, so that its not coming to pass would fall on the reception."@en ;
