pmc:AshtarTransmissionSummerActivityPrediction a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Forecast: unusual weather and active ships from April to September 1953"@en, "Vorhersage: ungewöhnliches Wetter und aktive Schiffe von April bis September 1953"@de ;
    skos:definition "Ashtar says the group will go on seeing very unusual weather and that many ventlas from the substations will be very active in the atmosphere from April to September."@en ;
