pmc:AshtarTransmissionThirtyDaysPrediction a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Forecast: violence on earth and another verified warning within thirty days"@en, "Vorhersage: Gewalt auf der Erde und eine weitere bestätigte Warnung binnen dreißig Tagen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Ashtar says the three substations will take an active part in violent occurrences about to happen and that another of the warnings will be verified within the next thirty days."@en ;
    skos:note "Dated to thirty days from 13 March 1953; the book closes a week later without a report."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a condition of failure: a forecast with an outcome in the public world, so that its not coming to pass would fall on the reception."@en ;
