pmc:AshtarTransmissionHallucinationsPrediction a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Forecast: more phenomena that people will call hallucinations"@en, "Vorhersage: mehr Phänomene, die man Halluzinationen nennen wird"@de ;
    skos:definition "Ashtar says the group will hear of more phenomena that people will call hallucinations, tells it not to be alarmed by unusual events nearby and to be prepared for anything."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a condition of failure: a forecast with an outcome in the public world, so that its not coming to pass would fall on the reception."@en ;
