pmc:AshtarTransmissionTrappingAvailsNaught a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Every attempt to trap or destroy the ships avails nothing"@en, "Jeder Versuch, die Schiffe zu fangen oder zu zerstören, bleibt vergeblich"@de ;
    skos:definition "Clatu says the ships cannot be shot down; Ashtar says it would be easier to trap a figure off a television screen and that all efforts made with the aim of destruction will avail nothing, since the ships are of light substance."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a condition of failure: it names the null outcome of a rival practice and its cause. It is stated against the authorities' practice and not against any practice of the group."@en ;
