    dcterms:source "George W. Van Tassel, I Rode a Flying Saucer! The Mystery of the Flying Saucers Revealed, second edition, revised and enlarged (Los Angeles: New Age Publishing Co., 1952), p. 37, message of 17 August 1952; read in the full-text layer of that edition" .

pmc:AshtarTransmissionStreaksSign a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Two luminous streaks overhead going out at once"@en, "Zwei leuchtende Streifen über der Gruppe, die zugleich erlöschen"@de ;
    skos:definition "After Rea's message several members saw two luminous streaks overhead disappear along their whole length at the same instant, which the author calls a display of light control."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success and not as a condition of failure: it is reported after the event as confirmation, and nothing in the work says what would have counted against it."@en ;
