pmc:AshtarTransmissionWashingtonSign a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Record sightings, including over Washington"@en, "Rekordsichtungen, auch über Washington"@de ;
    skos:definition "The author's fulfilment of Clota's forecast: more saucers were seen from May to August than ever before."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success and not as a condition of failure: it is reported after the event as confirmation, and nothing in the work says what would have counted against it."@en ;
