pmc:AshtarTransmissionLetterSign a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "The buzz over Washington after a letter to Air Force Intelligence"@en, "Der Überflug über Washington nach einem Brief an den Luftwaffennachrichtendienst"@de ;
    skos:definition "The author's fulfilment of Noma's forecast: a letter he sent to Air Force Intelligence at the beings' request reached it on 22 July 1952 by the return receipt, and the buzz came on 26 to 28 July; he cannot take the sequence for coincidence and believes the beings timed it to show the information was authentic."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success and not as a condition of failure: it is reported after the event as confirmation, and nothing in the work says what would have counted against it."@en ;
