pmc:AshtarTransmissionAnemiaSign a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Reports of a rise in pernicious anemia after the Nevada tests"@en, "Berichte über eine Zunahme perniziöser Anämie nach den Tests in Nevada"@de ;
    skos:definition "The author's fulfilment of Kerrull's forecast, which he says medical science can verify."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success and not as a condition of failure: it is reported after the event as confirmation, and nothing in the work says what would have counted against it."@en ;
