pmc:AshtarTransmissionPacificStormSign a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "A storm in the Pacific as evidence"@en, "Ein Sturm im Pazifik als Beweis"@de ;
    skos:definition "Ashtar says the group has been given enough evidence through a recent storm in the Pacific and through the verification of much it was told, and that most of the group has accepted the beings through proof."@en ;
