pmc:AshtarTransmissionDallasSign a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "An arrow in the sky above Dallas"@en, "Ein über Dallas gesehener Pfeil am Himmel"@de ;
    skos:definition "The author's fulfilment of the message of 3 October: an arrow over Dallas, read through Oahspe as the sign of spirit, verifies it and reveals the return of Christ consciousness."@en ;
